### H5 — Symlink residual  → **path-A sealed (leaf + parent)**

| Attack | Result |
|--------|--------|
| Leaf symlink under writedir targeting outside | deny; outside content intact |
| Parent dir symlink hop out of writedir | deny; no create outside |
| `O_NOFOLLOW` on leaf open after allow | fail-closed on race swap to symlink |

**Not sealed:** intermediate-component rename races / no landlock (MED residual — same class as T3 W8).

### H6 — Hardlink residual (T3 residual honesty)  → **OPEN HIGH (not fixed this pass)**

Live:

```text
hardlink outside → writedir leaf; write under OODA_FS_WRITEDIR
→ write ok=1; outside file content becomes write payload (PWNED_HARD class)
```

Why path-A does not block: hardlink is a regular directory entry; `realpath` stays under writedir; `openat(O_NOFOLLOW)` follows hardlinks (not symlinks). Optional harden residual: refuse `st_nlink > 1` after open (FP risk on intentional multi-link files) or landlock/pathfd seal.

**OWN this pass:** document residual honesty only. **Not** CRIT fail-open of FsReadCap/FsWriteCap map. Same residual as `audit/t3_security.oot` W7.

### H7 — Emit / build honesty residual (CAP-G3 class)  → **RESIDUAL (not CRIT check fail-open)**

