| `emit-c` does **not** run `check` | Can emit `write_file(fs, …)` for FsReadCap source; check would have denied |
| `build` does **not** re-run `check` | Same class as product residual (pre-CAP-G2) |
| Param names `fsread` / `fswrite` | Not in fixed main inject set → uninitialized at runtime (fail-closed / UB class) |

**Not fixed this pass** (non-CRIT relative to check dual-path; CAP-G3 type→`oo_cap_grant_fsread|fswrite` map). Dual-path product seal remains: **`oodac check` refuse + runtime wrong-token refuse**.

