## Root-cause notes (for DE / SPRINT CAP-G2)

1. **Check preferred map** — tip mirrors CAP-G1: `sealed_fs_kind_of` + exact/supersede only. Do not re-introduce inverted “any fs granular satisfies all fs ops.”

2. **Runtime** — `require_fsread`/`require_fswrite` must stay exact granular **or** full `g_tok_fs`. Do not accept cross-granular (fsread for write).

3. **Writedir overlay** — keep fail-closed unset/empty/root; realpath prefix; `openat(O_NOFOLLOW)`. **Hardlink FN remains** — document, optional later harden.

4. **CAP-G3** — type-driven main inject (`FsReadCap`→`oo_cap_grant_fsread`, etc.) closes emit honesty when param named `fs` declares read-only type. Out of CRITICAL CAP-G2 check scope.

5. **Fixtures / smoke** — recommend `wrong_granular_fsread_for_write.oo` + `cap_g2_fs_granular_smoke.sh` (integration/hygiene lane), not security thrash.

